<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bills show mixed direction at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bills show mixed direction at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on short-term Latvian Treasury bills dipped at auction on Wednesday but longer-term rates rose, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	 9.79	   9.97	 1.0    2.25   1.0</p>
<p> 91-day	10.33	  10.42	 1.25   2.57   1.25</p>
<p> Six-month   11.97	  11.93	 2.5    3.71   2.5</p>
<p> One-year    12.95	  12.85	 1.25   1.66   1.25</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
